# Setup success — Invite and verify vendors (Bugbot autofix)

**Symptom:** After onboarding completes (often with vendors imported on Review), **Invite and verify vendors** is already checked / never reminds the landlord to send verification invites. Or clicking the step always points at **Add vendor** even when the roster already has not-activated vendors.

**Cause:** Completing `verify_vendors` with `vendorCount > 0` (roster only). Onboarding import creates `vendors` rows but does **not** send invites (`onboarding-auto-activation`: manual outreach from Vendors).

## Rule

| Signal | Completes `verify_vendors`? |
|---|---|
| Vendor on roster only (import / Add vendor save) | **No** |
| Any `vendor_verifications` row for that vendor (invited / in progress / submitted / verified / needs_review) | **Yes** |
| `vendors.onboarding_overridden_at` set | **Yes** |

Mirror tenant welcome texts: residents existing ≠ welcome sent; vendors existing ≠ invite started.

Use `vendorOutreachStartedCount` (or equivalent) in `resolveSetupSuccessProgress` — **not** raw `vendorCount`.

### Coachmark (Vendors page)

When the Get set up step opens `/admin/vendors` with the setup guide:

| Roster state | Guide |
|---|---|
| No vendors | **Add vendor** |
| ≥1 Not activated (no verification / not overridden) | Row **checkbox** → Start onboarding / send invite |
| All already outreach-started | Do not fake a handoff coachmark |

## Autofix (Bugbot)

On PR review or when this symptom appears in chat:

1. Grep `verify_vendors:` / `vendorCount > 0` in setup-success progress. If completion is roster-only, switch to outreach-started count.
2. Ensure `loadSetupSuccessProgress` (and any Overview duplicate) counts override **or** any verification row — not only `status === 'verified'`.
3. Vendors setup guide: if `not_started` vendors exist, show checkbox coachmark; only empty roster uses Add vendor.
4. Keep tests: roster-only → incomplete; outreach started → complete.
5. After invite send, keep `notifySetupSuccessProgressChanged` so the card/nav percent updates.

**Note:** Cursor Bugbot runs on pull requests. Agents must apply this when the symptom appears in chat or PR.

## Where it lives

- Progress: `src/lib/setupSuccessChecklist.ts` → `resolveSetupSuccessProgress`
- Load: `src/lib/loadSetupSuccessProgress.ts`
- Guide routing: `src/lib/setupSuccessGuide.ts` (`verify_vendors` → `vendors`)
- UI coachmark: `src/components/AdminVendorsDashboard.tsx`
- Manual invite policy: `.cursor/rules/onboarding-auto-activation.mdc`

## Do not

- Mark `verify_vendors` done solely because `vendors.length > 0`
- Treat onboarding vendor import as “invited”
- Always coach **Add vendor** when imported not-activated vendors already exist
- Auto-send vendor verification on `completeOnboarding` (manual only)
